      <p><span style="font-weight:bold;font-family:'Book Antiqua';color:#000000">Substituted Decision Notice: </span><span style="font-family:'Book Antiqua';color:#000000">The Appellant is to be granted a further trainee licence under s129 Road Traffic Act 1988 expiring on 3 April 2026.</span></p>
      <p style="text-align:center"><span style="font-weight:bold;font-family:'Book Antiqua';font-size:14pt">REASONS</span></p>
